<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ET Cons slips into Sept qtr loss.</title>
<headline>ET Cons slips into Sept qtr loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss before capital spending     3.69   vs 3.92   profit</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   2.36   vs 3.88</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled			    85,404   vs 94,301</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			    573   vs 643</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)				6.7   vs 6.8</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			   57,412   vs 53,129</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)			52,646   vs 52,179</p>
<p>Full name: Eastern Transvaal Consolidated Mines Ltd, managed by Anglovaal Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
